# Scratch goes in __repos/oc-scratch/opencode-companion/, never inside a repository.
# Delete your own scratch when done; keep only receipts a record cites. Browser runners delete their Chrome profiles.
# Old scratch exclusions remain as a fallback; never mapped.
steer_*.md
tmp
tmp_*
scratch
scratch_*
*.tmp
*.bak
*.orig

# Compressed test fixtures (e.g. scripts/fixtures/telemetry/*.json.gz): binary, nothing to map.
*.gz

# oc_pack build output: <package name>-<12-hex package id>.md (e.g. packages/exportimport-d286f6d91530.md).
# Generated copies of Workflowy/source content, NOT source; they embed @beacon blocks from other repos.
*-????????????.md

# The test tree and test files: tests read their files (fixtures, corpora) from disk; nothing navigates them through the map.
tests
test_*
fixtures
